<section class="finance-faq">
    <div class="finance-faq__container">
      <h2 class="finance-faq__title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      
      <div class="finance-faq__columns">
        <div class="finance-faq__column">
          <h3 class="finance-faq__column-title">Affirm Financing</h3>
          <div class="finance-faq__accordion">
            <div class="finance-faq__accordion-item">
              <input type="checkbox" id="affirm-1-{{ section.id }}" class="finance-faq__accordion-checkbox">
              <label for="affirm-1-{{ section.id }}" class="finance-faq__accordion-btn">What is Affirm?</label>
              <div class="finance-faq__accordion-content">
                <p>Affirm is a financing alternative to credit cards and other credit-payment products. Affirm offers payment options for eligible customers to pay for their purchase over time in fixed installments, with no late or hidden fees.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="finance-faq__accordion-item">
              <input type="checkbox" id="affirm-2-{{ section.id }}" class="finance-faq__accordion-checkbox">
              <label for="affirm-2-{{ section.id }}" class="finance-faq__accordion-btn">How do I apply for Affirm financing?</label>
              <div class="finance-faq__accordion-content">
                <p>You can apply for Affirm financing directly at checkout. Simply select Affirm as your payment method, and you'll be guided through the application process.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="finance-faq__accordion-item">
              <input type="checkbox" id="affirm-3-{{ section.id }}" class="finance-faq__accordion-checkbox">
              <label for="affirm-3-{{ section.id }}" class="finance-faq__accordion-btn">What are the payment options with Affirm?</label>
              <div class="finance-faq__accordion-content">
                <p>Affirm offers flexible payment plans of 3, 6, or 9 months. You can choose the plan that best fits your budget during the checkout process.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="finance-faq__accordion-item">
              <input type="checkbox" id="affirm-4-{{ section.id }}" class="finance-faq__accordion-checkbox">
              <label for="affirm-4-{{ section.id }}" class="finance-faq__accordion-btn">What is required to have an Affirm account?</label>
              <div class="finance-faq__accordion-content">
                <p>To sign up for Affirm, you must:</p>
                <ul>
                  <li>Be a resident of the U.S. (including U.S. territories)</li>
                  <li>Be at least 18 years old (19 if you're a ward of the state of Nebraska)</li>
                  <li>Have a Social Security number</li>
                  <li>Own a phone number that receives SMS and is registered to the United States or U.S. territories.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="finance-faq__accordion-item">
              <input type="checkbox" id="affirm-5-{{ section.id }}" class="finance-faq__accordion-checkbox">
              <label for="affirm-5-{{ section.id }}" class="finance-faq__accordion-btn">Does Affirm perform a credit check? Do it impact my credit score?</label>
              <div class="finance-faq__accordion-content">
                <p>Although Affirm performs a credit check when you apply for a loan, this won't impact your credit score. However, if you're approved and decide to buy with Affirm, your loan and payments may affect your credit score. Paying on time can help you build a positive credit history.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="finance-faq__column">
          <h3 class="finance-faq__column-title">Resolve Financing</h3>
          <div class="finance-faq__accordion">
            <div class="finance-faq__accordion-item">
              <input type="checkbox" id="resolve-1-{{ section.id }}" class="finance-faq__accordion-checkbox">
              <label for="resolve-1-{{ section.id }}" class="finance-faq__accordion-btn">What is Resolve?</label>
              <div class="finance-faq__accordion-content">
                <p>Resolve is a financing solution designed for our commercial customers, offering extended payment terms and seamless integration with your purchasing system.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="finance-faq__accordion-item">
              <input type="checkbox" id="resolve-2-{{ section.id }}" class="finance-faq__accordion-checkbox">
              <label for="resolve-2-{{ section.id }}" class="finance-faq__accordion-btn">Who is eligible for Resolve financing?</label>
              <div class="finance-faq__accordion-content">
                <p>Resolve financing is available exclusively to our Partner+ members, which include interior designers, contractors, and architects who order from us more than once.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="finance-faq__accordion-item">
              <input type="checkbox" id="resolve-3-{{ section.id }}" class="finance-faq__accordion-checkbox">
              <label for="resolve-3-{{ section.id }}" class="finance-faq__accordion-btn">What are the payment terms with Resolve?</label>
              <div class="finance-faq__accordion-content">
                <p>Resolve offers 60-day payment terms, giving you more flexibility to manage your cash flow.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="finance-faq__accordion-item">
              <input type="checkbox" id="resolve-4-{{ section.id }}" class="finance-faq__accordion-checkbox">
              <label for="resolve-4-{{ section.id }}" class="finance-faq__accordion-btn">How do I apply for Resolve financing?</label>
              <div class="finance-faq__accordion-content">
                <p>To apply for Resolve financing, simply fill out the form.</p>
                <a href="#" class="finance-faq__link">Apply Now</a>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="finance-faq__accordion-item">
              <input type="checkbox" id="resolve-5-{{ section.id }}" class="finance-faq__accordion-checkbox">
              <label for="resolve-5-{{ section.id }}" class="finance-faq__accordion-btn">What are the benefits of using Resolve?</label>
              <div class="finance-faq__accordion-content">
                <p>Resolve provides extended payment terms, easy integration with your purchasing system, and is tailored specifically for our repeat commercial customers.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="finance-faq__accordion-item">
              <input type="checkbox" id="resolve-6-{{ section.id }}" class="finance-faq__accordion-checkbox">
              <label for="resolve-6-{{ section.id }}" class="finance-faq__accordion-btn">How do I become a Partner+ member?</label>
              <div class="finance-faq__accordion-content">
                <p>Whether you're a home renovation professional or an interior designer, we invite you to join our Partner+ program for members-only access to exclusive products, and much more.</p>
                <a href="#" class="finance-faq__link">Apply Now</a>
                <a href="#" class="finance-faq__link">Learn More</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <style>
    .finance-faq {
      padding: 80px 0;
      background-color: #fff;
    }
  
    .finance-faq__container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }
  
    .finance-faq__title {
      font-size: 48px;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }
  
    .finance-faq__columns {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 40px;
    }
  
    .finance-faq__column {
      flex: 1;
    }
  
    .finance-faq__column-title {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
  
    .finance-faq__accordion-item {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
  
    .finance-faq__accordion-checkbox {
      display: none;
    }
  
    .finance-faq__accordion-btn {
      background-color: white;
      color: #333;
      cursor: pointer;
      padding: 18px;
      width: 100%;
      text-align: left;
      border: none;
      outline: none;
      transition: 0.4s;
      font-weight: bold;
      display: block;
    }
  
    .finance-faq__accordion-btn:hover {
      background-color: #ddd;
    }
  
    .finance-faq__accordion-content {
      padding: 0 18px;
      background-color: white;
      max-height: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: max-height 0.2s ease-out;
    }
  
    .finance-faq__accordion-checkbox:checked + .finance-faq__accordion-btn {
      background-color: #ddd;
    }
  
    .finance-faq__accordion-checkbox:checked + .finance-faq__accordion-btn + .finance-faq__accordion-content {
      max-height: 1000px; /* Adjust this value based on your content */
    }
  
    .finance-faq__link {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 10px;
      margin-right: 10px;
      color: #black;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
  
    .finance-faq__link:hover {
      color: #0066cc; 
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
  
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .finance-faq__columns {
        flex-direction: column;
      }
  
      .finance-faq__title {
        font-size: 36px;
      }
    }
  </style>
  
  {% schema %}
  {
    "name": "Finance FAQ",
    "settings": [],
    "presets": [
      {
        "name": "Finance FAQ",
        "category": "Custom Sections"
      }
    ]
  }
  {% endschema %}